{%- comment -%} THE MAPLE WHEEL v7 (one-button) — Curated Clinicals Canada Day week (Jul 1-7 2026). Simplest possible flow: enter email -> press SPIN -> wheel auto-spins (uniform random landing, ~4.6s ease-out w/ flapper ticks + near-miss crawl) -> minimal prize card (emoji, title, code, one-line terms, CASH OUT, next-spin countdown). ONE spin/day, no practice mode. 14 wedges = the odds ($10x3, SHIPx3, $15x2, GIFTx2, RESPINx2 auto-respins, $25, JACKPOT $40). Prizes = real capped single-use codes (SHIP $50+/$10 $75+/GIFT $100+/$15 $125+/$25 $175+/$40 $250+), all stack with the 20% sale, expire 2026-07-08T06:59:59Z. Anti-abuse: email+honeypot+date/clock guards, pend at spin start (refresh mid-spin forfeits to $10), daily cookie; hard bound = once/customer + caps. m5 legacy tier kept for old wallets' code lookup only. Mounted from layout/theme.liquid. Self-hides after game end. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
#mps-tab{position:fixed;right:0;bottom:110px;z-index:9998;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e01936,#8f0618);color:#fff;border:0;padding:13px 9px 15px;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:-5px 6px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:inherit;transition:transform .18s ease;animation:mpsPulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes mpsPulse{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}50%{transform:translateX(-4px)}}
#mps-tab:hover{transform:translateX(-4px)}
#mps-tab .g1{font-size:21px;line-height:1}
#mps-tab .g2{writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
#mps-tab .g3{background:#d4ba6a;color:#2b1d00;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:5px;letter-spacing:.5px}
@media(max-width:600px){#mps-tab{bottom:84px;padding:11px 8px 13px}#mps-tab .g2{font-size:10px}}
#mps[hidden]{display:none}
#mps{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:99999;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;font-family:inherit}
#mps .mps-ov{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(12,8,4,.74);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}
#mps .mps-card{position:relative;background:#171310;color:#f3ede2;max-width:420px;width:100%;border-radius:22px;padding:22px 20px 18px;box-shadow:0 34px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.6),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);text-align:center;animation:mpsIn .35s ease;max-height:94vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid #3a2f22}
@keyframes mpsIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px) scale(.98)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
#mps .mps-x{position:absolute;top:8px;right:13px;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:26px;line-height:1;color:#7d715f;cursor:pointer;z-index:6}
#mps .mps-x:hover{color:#f3ede2}
#mps .mps-snd{position:absolute;top:10px;left:13px;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:17px;line-height:1;color:#7d715f;cursor:pointer;z-index:6}
#mps .mps-ey{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:10.5px;color:#d4ba6a;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 3px}
#mps .mps-ti{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:25px;margin:0 0 2px;line-height:1.1;color:#fff}
#mps .mps-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:#a99a82;margin:0 0 10px}
#mps .mps-board{position:relative;margin:0 0 4px}
#mps .mps-board.shake{animation:mpsShake .4s ease}
@keyframes mpsShake{0%,100%{transform:none}25%{transform:translateX(-4px) rotate(-.4deg)}75%{transform:translateX(4px) rotate(.4deg)}}
#mps .mps-board.megashake{animation:mpsMega .7s ease}
@keyframes mpsMega{0%,100%{transform:none}15%{transform:translate(-6px,2px) rotate(-.8deg)}35%{transform:translate(6px,-2px) rotate(.8deg)}55%{transform:translate(-5px,1px) rotate(-.6deg)}75%{transform:translate(4px,-1px) rotate(.5deg)}}
#mps canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
#mps .mps-scorepop{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:6px;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#ffd76a;text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,215,106,.6);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:4}
#mps .mps-scorepop.go{animation:mpsRise 1.1s ease forwards}
@keyframes mpsRise{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px) scale(.8)}25%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-2px) scale(1.08)}70%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-30px) scale(1)}}
#mps .mps-em{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1.5px solid #4a3c28;background:#0f0c09;color:#f3ede2;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:16px;margin:2px 0 0;font-family:inherit}
